DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260818T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260818T180000
SUMMARY:Core Conditioning
LOCATION:DG Bodyworks\, 7 Depot Street\, Proctorsville\, VT\, 05153\, Unit
 ed States
URL:https://vermontjournal.com/event/core-conditioning/2026-08-18/
CATEGORIES:kids\,Vermont Journal & Shopper
DESCRIPTION:A Fitness Class that blends concepts from Pilates\, and barre\
 , to deliver a full-body workout that tones\, sculpts\, and strengthens. U
 sing high-rep\, low-impact movements with bodyweight\, this class builds l
 ean muscle\, boosts endurance\, and improves core stability and posture. E
 xpect a dynamic\, energizing experience that leaves you feeling strong\, b
 alanced\, and empowered. All fitness levels welcome with options to modify
  or intensify.\nSource: Vermont Journal & Shopper
END:VEVENT
