SUMMARY:Morrisville Live: Summer Music Series
LOCATION:Oxbow Riverfront Park\, Portland Street\, Morrisville\, VT\, 0566
 1\, United States
URL:https://vermontjournal.com/event/morrisville-live-summer-music-series/
 2026-08-19/
CATEGORIES:kids\,Vermont Journal & Shopper
DESCRIPTION:Summer means music at Oxbow Park. Morrisville Live is a free\,
  seven-week concert series held Wednesday evenings\, July 8–August 19\, 
 2026 (5:30–7:30 PM). Enjoy an eclectic mix of R&B\, soul\, blues\, rock\
 , and more in a relaxed\, scenic setting in the heart of the Lamoille Vall
 ey—just minutes from Stowe. \nA longtime community tradition\, Morrisvil
 le Live brings together residents and visitors for great music\, local foo
 d\, crafts\, and family-friendly activities. Bring a chair or blanket\, ga
 ther with friends and family\, and enjoy a welcoming summer evening by the
  river.\nSource: Vermont Journal & Shopper
END:VEVENT
