URL:https://vermontjournal.com/event/the-family-vacation-classic-clowntown
 -cinema-double-feature/2026-08-21/
CATEGORIES:kids\,Vermont Journal & Shopper
DESCRIPTION:Tickets by donation at the door!\nFriday\, Aug 21 at 7 PM\nSat
 urday\, Aug 22 at 2 PM & 7 PM \nThe Duchess of Navarre decides it’s time
  that the family take a trip to the seaside\; everyone else is doing it\, 
 why shouldn’t they? Unfortunately\, the tides take a turn for the worst\
 , and they have to battle not only sunburns\, sand\, and squid\, but also
 …each other. \nSome of the classic comedy of the 1930s revived for this 
 show and this show only! Marx Brothers\, Charlie Chaplin\, Buster Keaton a
 nd more\, the clowns of Clowntown take on the greats!\nSource: Vermont Jou
 rnal & Shopper
