SUMMARY:Nature Play
URL:https://sapcc-vt.org/event/nature-play/
CATEGORIES:kids\,Springfield Area Parent Child Center
DESCRIPTION:Nature Play at The Commons\nJoin the Springfield Area Parent C
 hild Center (SAPCC) for a fun-filled morning of outdoor exploration and se
 nsory play at The Commons located in Springfield\, VT on Tuesday\, Sept
 ember 1\, from 10:00–11:30 AM. \nChildren and their caregivers will enjo
 y hands-on\, nature-inspired activities including creating and decorating 
 mud cakes in the mud kitchen\, exploring sensory-based nature art\, engagi
 ng in imaginative outdoor play\, and building miniature worlds using natur
 al materials. \nWe’ll wrap up our morning with a story and a healthy sna
 ck. All materials will be provided—just bring your curiosity and dress f
 or outdoor play that might get a little messy! \nWhen: Tuesday\, Septembe
 r 1\nTime: 10:00–11:30 AM\nWhere: The Commons in Springfield\, VT \nTh
 is free program is open to families with young children. We hope you’ll 
 join us for a morning of creativity\, connection\, and outdoor fun! \n  \
 nQuestions? krista.wilson@sapcc-vt.org or 802-886-5242\nSource: Springfiel
 d Area Parent Child Center
END:VEVENT
